  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed rear dormer in conjunction with the raised ridge height would result in excessive scale and massing, giving rise to an incongruous, bulky, obtrusive, top-heavy, and dominating addition to the host dwellinghouse which would fail to respect the scale, character, massing, composition, and design of the host dwellinghouse and neighbouring properties. The proposal would therefore result in a detrimental impact to the character and appearance of the host dwellinghouse and locality, contrary to the high-quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), Policy GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021 – 2041), and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
